        30
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fryeburg%2C_Maine"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The first permanent settlement in Fryeburg was established in 1763 by Nathaniel Smith and his family from Concord, New Hampshire.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fryeburg%2C_Maine"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Fryeburg Academy is a private preparatory school that has been part of the community since it was founded in 1792.",
